From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: allolive <160342668+allolive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 11:59:28 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 09/14] player info panel redesign

Reworks the fullscreen info (DialogSeekBar): a right-aligned media
flag row replaces the MediaFlags include, and the info panel becomes
taller with a TV eyebrow, wrapping title, facts and rating lines, the
plot, and a new credits column (director and cast).
---
 xml/DialogSeekBar.xml | 248 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 xml/Includes.xml      |  18 +++
 2 files changed, 248 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

diff --git a/xml/DialogSeekBar.xml b/xml/DialogSeekBar.xml
index b63c7bb..bca5780 100644
